00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, thank you!
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.770 line:92%
I am so happy to be here.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.373
But, uh, I gotta hurry this up,
'cause I told my wife

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was taking out the trash,
so I got to get back.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:10.577 line:92%
You know, I wanted to bring her,

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:14.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, unfortunately,
my wife is the fun police.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I know a lot of you women
who are in relationships

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:20.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
don't ever think
you can become the fun police,

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:24.090 align:start size:94% position:6%
