told me to tell you,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
y'all become
the fun police, man.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you know how crazy
guys look

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
