"Hey, Finesse,

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:33.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
let's go to the sports bar,
and have some beers

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
and catch up
and watch the game,"

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then you hear,
"Whoop whoop whoop!"

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"What was that?"

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.275 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"My wife."

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:42.809 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
"She just magically appears
when anybody invite me

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.515 align:start size:94% position:6%
to try to go have fun
without her."

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:49.349 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
