00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.250 line:92%
"But she might let me go.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hold on.
Hold on one second.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.220
Hey, babe, I'ma hang out with
the fellas at the sports bar

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.623 align:start size:94% position:6%
and have some beers.
Is that cool?"

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
"That sounds dumb.
Stay with me."

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
