00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I'm busy.
I can't go."

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.768 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:09.436 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"But you know what?

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
Y'all go on
and have a good time, man.

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:13.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm just gonna hang out here
with my soul mate

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:17.477
and stay around her, with
her positive attitude all day."

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.345 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.647 line:92%
But I'ma keep it real, man.

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:23.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife is one thousand.
I love this woman.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:24.784 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She is phenomenal,

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:27.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'd rather have that
than the alternative.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.855 line:92%
'Cause I got a friend who like,

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.825
"Well, I don't have to go
through all that, Finesse.

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:33.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife let me come and go
as I please.

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't even tell her
where I'm going.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.230 line:92%
I come home whenever I want to."

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:41.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like,
"Oh, well...

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.036 size:78% position:39% line:92%
she cheating on you."

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.571 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
