00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:48.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
"'Cause real love
is asking permission."

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:49.309 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:50.110 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"And if that don't work,

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
follow it by
a well-thought-out lie.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:53.880 line:92%
That's real love right there."

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.248 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:56.416 line:92%
And we don't want to lie.

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.151 line:92%
You know, we don't want to lie.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.752 line:92%
But sometimes you get an invite,

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:03.223 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you just can't say
the invite as is to your wife.

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:06.759
Your boy call you, "Hey,
Finesse, I just got invited

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the private party
of the century,

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:12.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you invited
'cause I'm invited.

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:14.200 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know Beyoncé?"
You're like, "Yeah!"

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, it's not her,
but her third cousin Keyoncé

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.307 size:84% position:42%
Is having the party.
But Beyoncé might come.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if Beyoncé come,
I'ma text you

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:24.477 line:92%
and send you the address.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
Say whatever you got to say
to get out the house."

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:27.981 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm like, "Cool!"

00:02:27.981 --> 00:02:30.984
So by the time you go to your
wife and tell her the invite,

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:32.986 line:92%
it come out more like this.

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.355 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Sighs ]

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:40.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Babe...
Steve called again.

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:45.198 size:84% position:42%
Said something about
he lost his job, and...

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:47.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
he wanna go meet
at some raggedy bar.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.401 line:92%
Hardly nobody gonna be there.

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.235 line:92%
It's just gonna be me and him,

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:53.173
and he just want to, you know,
talk about it 'cause, you know,

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.741 line:92%
he going through something."

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:55.275 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
