00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:58.378 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know what?
I am so sick of Steve,

00:02:58.378 --> 00:03:00.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause he always
going through something."

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:02.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I know, babe.
It's crazy.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:05.952
But I'm his only friend,
so I feel like I got to go.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:06.452 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know?"

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:08.555
"And you know what?
I don't know if it's me or not,

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:10.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it seem like
he always go through something

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:12.659 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
