00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:16.796
"I ain't even been keeping track
like that, babe.

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:18.064 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know."

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:20.366 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Beep beep!

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Hey hey! Beyon--

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:25.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
Beyond me
why he keep calling me, babe.

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.073 size:78% position:39% line:92%
He get on my nerves."

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I tell you what,
married men.

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:29.976 line:92%
We all got a Steve in our life,

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
