how to either get rid of him,

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:36.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
because him and our marriage,
they can't coexist.

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:37.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, even when you
just with your old lady,

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:41.788 align:start size:94% position:6%
