"Mnh-mnh, mnh-mnh."

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:34.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
"But you always want to go."
"Mnh-mnh."

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:37.010 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, oh, oh.
